{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120697","id":3948438724,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7rWGTE","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120697","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120697.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120697.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120697","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120697/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120697/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120697/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f0e99d84fc0718045453ff1f21f60fc5a88d2a0c","number":120697,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Make tie with scenes imported into `MeshLibrary` resources explicit","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Currently, when you import a scene into a library with the `MeshLibrary` editor, it tags the library with a metadata called `_editor_source_scene` that contains the scene's path, and then enabled the option to update from it. However, that connection is implicit and fickle:\r\n- If the scene is moved, the path is not updated.\r\n- The editor doesn't check for it again once the library is reopened, unless you import a scene to it again.\r\n\r\nThis PR makes that tie more explicit:\r\n- The scene's path is now stored as an UID. So moving the scene updates it as well.\r\n- The editor now always check if a source scene is available.\r\n- You can now untie the scene from it if you want to.\r\n- Export a scene into a `MeshLibrary` via the the \"Scene\" menu also sets a source scene as well.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"